Package: gog
Title: Grammar of Graphics
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person("psychometrician", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "psychometrician@gmail.com")
Description: R interface to the gog (Grammar of Graphics) engine.
    Provides a composable DSL using the + operator to build plots from
    marks, encodings, and data. Plots render via the gog-cli Rust binary.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/psychometrician/gog,
    https://psychometrician.github.io/gog-book/
BugReports: https://github.com/psychometrician/gog/issues
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    utils
Suggests:
    DBI,
    RSQLite,
    gapminder,
    IRdisplay,
    knitr,
    pkgload,
    repr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
